1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,280
Let me give you an example: I compare myself with someone else.

2
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:09,088
Am I and he the same? Yes. Now guarantee me… guarantee me

3
00:00:09,088 --> 00:00:13,520
that it isn't… that he and I — meaning he —

4
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:17,760
that he isn't… standing on a box.

5
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:21,520
And guarantee me he isn't sitting in a hole. I don't know

6
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:26,320
what his circumstances are. I don't know them — so he and I

7
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,760
are different. The comparison collapses: comparing two different

8
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:33,160
people doesn't work. He and I differ, so it collapses. Fine — two

9
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,640
comparisons with another person? Those collapse too.

10
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:40,480
Comparisons are useful, not binding — meaning I compare myself

11
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:47,560
to be guided, not to flog myself.

12
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:53,640
Its effect and its result: upward comparison,

13
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:58,200
and downward comparison. The positive effect

14
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,240
and the negative effect give me four cases.

15
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:07,240
Upward comparison with its positive effect —

16
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:09,200
this gives me inspiration. I compare myself with someone

17
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:11,480
above me: 'You're good, you're great on the podcast.'

18
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:16,680
Its positive effect gave me inspiration: what is he doing?

19
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,040
I'll do the same. Upward comparison with

20
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:21,680
its positive effect: 'You're good on the podcast.'

21
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:25,360
These differences, between this and that, oblige a person

22
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:32,960
to strive to be better — not to be the best.

23
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:39,760
Why not be the best? That will ruin your principles.

24
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:43,040
You will create enmities, burn yourself out, and disdain the blessing

25
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:48,040
God has given you — and you defy the laws of the universe.

26
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:50,840
To strive to be the best means you compete with

27
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:54,560
others' destinies — not with others. This is his destiny,

28
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:58,880
this is his provision; you cannot. To strive to be better

29
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:01,911
means you work on yourself. A story I may have mentioned…

30
00:02:01,911 --> 00:02:07,700
before — I'll bring it up in this context.

31
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:14,620
The man who sells chicks…

32
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:20,020
so he plays music, and the chicks start dancing.

33
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:22,540
People came and bought; one man bought and went home.

34
00:02:22,540 --> 00:02:25,820
He wanted to dance — they didn't. He tried again — nothing. He changed

35
00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:30,500
the song for them — nothing. He played the same song — they didn't

36
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:36,700
dance with their chicks, and the man ran away.

37
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:38,380
The man had pulled a trick: the metal sheet underneath

38
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:44,580
held the chicks. What was under the chicks was

39
00:02:44,980 --> 00:02:49,380
hot, so the chicks kept lifting their feet — and so they were

40
00:02:49,380 --> 00:03:00,860
dancing. People took the chicks and left the sheet.

41
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:07,940
The chick itself: when you try to take someone's life, or

42
00:03:07,940 --> 00:03:14,140
someone's idea, or someone's style — you took the chick,

43
00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:18,100
if you took it; but you cannot take that.

44
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:21,460
Because the sheet is God's decree, glorified be He —

45
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:24,620
his mother's prayers… the sheet may be a trial from

46
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:27,580
God, for God tests

47
00:03:27,580 --> 00:03:30,500
with good as well, and tests with success. The sheet may

48
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:32,360
be his upbringing; the sheet may be charity, or

49
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:36,780
a prayer in secret — you do not know. This you cannot

50
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:42,020
take, and that — do not cling to what does not benefit you.

51
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:45,220
Focus on yourself: strive to be better, not to be

52
00:03:45,220 --> 00:03:47,280
the best. Well, now, if we want to wrap up the conversation…
